{
  "_README": [
    "Expected-values template for verifying stream_hud.py output.",
    "Fill in each frame's expected readings by watching the video at that t (seconds).",
    "Value shapes by region type (see hud_config.json):",
    "  int   -> number            e.g. 36",
    "  float -> number            e.g. 27.8",
    "  str   -> string            e.g. \"L3\"",
    "  unit_value -> [num, unit]  e.g. [74, \"W\"]  (power/distance/elevation)",
    "Set a region to null (or delete the key) to SKIP checking it on that frame.",
    "Timestamps must match a stream_hud run with the sampling below -- regenerate if you change start/end/fps."
  ],
